{"page":204,"verses":[{"verse_key":"9:107","surah":9,"ayah":107,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ ٱتَّخَذُوا۟ مَسْجِدًا ضِرَارًا وَكُفْرًا وَتَفْرِيقًۢا بَيْنَ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَإِرْصَادًا لِّمَنْ حَارَبَ ٱللَّهَ وَرَسُولَهُۥ مِن قَبْلُ ۚ وَلَيَحْلِفُنَّ إِنْ أَرَدْنَآ إِلَّا ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ ۖ وَٱللَّهُ يَشْهَدُ إِنَّهُمْ لَكَـٰذِبُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Then there are those who built a mosque––in an attempt to cause harm, disbelief, and disunity among the believers––as an outpost for those who fought God and His Messenger before: they swear, ‘Our intentions were nothing but good,’ but God bears witness that they are liars.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱتَّخَذُوا۟","en_gloss":"take","transliteration":"ittakhadhū","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَسْجِدًۭا","en_gloss":"a masjid","transliteration":"masjidan","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ضِرَارًۭا","en_gloss":"(for causing) harm","transliteration":"ḍirāran","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَكُفْرًۭا","en_gloss":"and (for) disbelief","transliteration":"wakuf'ran","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَتَفْرِيقًۢا","en_gloss":"and (for) division","transliteration":"watafrīqan","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minīna","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَإِرْصَادًۭا","en_gloss":"and (as) a station","transliteration":"wa-ir'ṣādan","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لِّمَنْ","en_gloss":"for whoever","transliteration":"liman","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":11,"ar":"حَارَبَ","en_gloss":"warred","transliteration":"ḥāraba","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"(against) Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَرَسُولَهُۥ","en_gloss":"and His Messenger","transliteration":"warasūlahu","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":15,"ar":"قَبْلُ ۚ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"qablu","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَلَيَحْلِفُنَّ","en_gloss":"And surely they will swear","transliteration":"walayaḥlifunna","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":17,"ar":"إِنْ","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":18,"ar":"أَرَدْنَآ","en_gloss":"we wish","transliteration":"aradnā","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":19,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":20,"ar":"ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ ۖ","en_gloss":"the good","transliteration":"l-ḥus'nā","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":21,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"But Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":22,"ar":"يَشْهَدُ","en_gloss":"bears witness","transliteration":"yashhadu","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":23,"ar":"إِنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"indeed, they","transliteration":"innahum","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":24,"ar":"لَكَـٰذِبُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) surely liars","transliteration":"lakādhibūna","verse_key":"9:107"},{"pos":25,"ar":"١٠٧","en_gloss":"(107)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:107"}]},{"verse_key":"9:108","surah":9,"ayah":108,"ar_uthmani":"لَا تَقُمْ فِيهِ أَبَدًا ۚ لَّمَسْجِدٌ أُسِّسَ عَلَى ٱلتَّقْوَىٰ مِنْ أَوَّلِ يَوْمٍ أَحَقُّ أَن تَقُومَ فِيهِ ۚ فِيهِ رِجَالٌ يُحِبُّونَ أَن يَتَطَهَّرُوا۟ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ يُحِبُّ ٱلْمُطَّهِّرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], never pray in that mosque. You should rather pray in a mosque founded from its first day on consciousness of God: in this mosque there are men who desire to grow in purity- God loves those who seek to purify themselves.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(Do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"9:108"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَقُمْ","en_gloss":"stand","transliteration":"taqum","verse_key":"9:108"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"9:108"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَبَدًۭا ۚ","en_g