y":"9:109","surah":9,"ayah":109,"ar_uthmani":"أَفَمَنْ أَسَّسَ بُنْيَـٰنَهُۥ عَلَىٰ تَقْوَىٰ مِنَ ٱللَّهِ وَرِضْوَٰنٍ خَيْرٌ أَم مَّنْ أَسَّسَ بُنْيَـٰنَهُۥ عَلَىٰ شَفَا جُرُفٍ هَارٍ فَٱنْهَارَ بِهِۦ فِى نَارِ جَهَنَّمَ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ لَا يَهْدِى ٱلْقَوْمَ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Which is better, the person who founds his building on consciousness of God and desire for His good pleasure, or the person who founds his building on the brink of a crumbling precipice that will tumble down into the Fire of Hell, taking him with it? God does not guide the evildoers:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَفَمَنْ","en_gloss":"Then is (one) who","transliteration":"afaman","verse_key":"9:109"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَسَّسَ","en_gloss":"founded","transliteration":"assasa","verse_key":"9:109"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بُنْيَـٰنَهُۥ","en_gloss":"his building","transliteration":"bun'yānahu","verse_key":"9:109"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"9:109"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَقْوَىٰ","en_gloss":"righteousness","transliteration":"taqwā","verse_key":"9:109"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"9:109"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"9:109"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَرِضْوَٰنٍ","en_gloss":"and (His) pleasure","transliteration":"wariḍ'wānin","verse_key":"9:109"},{"pos":9,"ar":"خَيْرٌ","en_gloss":"better","transliteration":"khayrun","verse_key":"9:109"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَم","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"9:109"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَّنْ","en_gloss":"(one) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"9:109"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَسَّسَ","en_gloss":"founded","transliteration":"assasa","verse_key":"9:109"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بُنْيَـٰنَهُۥ","en_gloss":"his building","transliteration":"bun'yānahu","verse_key":"9:109"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"9:109"},{"pos":15,"ar":"شَفَا","en_gloss":"edge","transliteration":"shafā","verse_k