"transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"9:110"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَنَوْا۟","en_gloss":"they built","transliteration":"banaw","verse_key":"9:110"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رِيبَةًۭ","en_gloss":"a (cause of) doubt","transliteration":"rībatan","verse_key":"9:110"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"9:110"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قُلُوبِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their hearts","transliteration":"qulūbihim","verse_key":"9:110"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَّآ","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"9:110"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"9:110"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تَقَطَّعَ","en_gloss":"(are) cut into pieces","transliteration":"taqaṭṭaʿa","verse_key":"9:110"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قُلُوبُهُمْ ۗ","en_gloss":"their hearts","transliteration":"qulūbuhum","verse_key":"9:110"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"9:110"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَلِيمٌ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"9:110"},{"pos":15,"ar":"حَكِيمٌ","en_gloss":"All-Wise","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","verse_key":"9:110"},{"pos":16,"ar":"١١٠","en_gloss":"(110)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:110"}]},{"verse_key":"9:111","surah":9,"ayah":111,"ar_uthmani":"۞ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ ٱشْتَرَىٰ مِنَ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ أَنفُسَهُمْ وَأَمْوَٰلَهُم بِأَنَّ لَهُمُ ٱلْجَنَّةَ ۚ يُقَـٰتِلُونَ فِى سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ فَيَقْتُلُونَ وَيُقْتَلُونَ ۖ وَعْدًا عَلَيْهِ حَقًّا فِى ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةِ وَٱلْإِنجِيلِ وَٱلْقُرْءَانِ ۚ وَمَنْ أَوْفَىٰ بِعَهْدِهِۦ مِنَ ٱللَّهِ ۚ فَٱسْتَبْشِرُوا۟ بِبَيْعِكُمُ ٱلَّذِى بَايَعْتُم بِهِۦ ۚ وَذَٰلِكَ هُوَ ٱلْفَوْزُ ٱلْعَظِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God has purchased the persons and possessions of the believers in return for the Garden- they fight in God’s way: they kill and are killed- this is a true promise given by Him in the Torah, the Gospel, and the Quran. Who could be more faithful to his promise than God? So be happy with the bargain you have made: that is the supreme triumph.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"9:111"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"9:111"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱشْتَرَىٰ","en_gloss":"(has) purchased","transliteration":"ish'tarā","verse_key":"9:111"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"9:111"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minīna","verse_key":"9:111"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَنفُسَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their lives","transliteration":"anfusahum","verse_key":"9:111"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَأَمْوَٰلَهُم","en_gloss":"and their wealth","transliteration":"wa-amwālahum","verse_key":"9:111"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِأَنَّ","en_gloss":"because","transliteration":"bi-anna","verse_key":"9:111"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَهُمُ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahumu","verse_key":"9:111"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْجَنَّةَ ۚ","en_gloss":"(is) Paradise","transliteration":"l-janata","verse_key":"9:111"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُقَـٰتِلُونَ","en_gloss":"They fight","transliteration":"yuqātilūna","verse_key":"9:111"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"9:111"},{"pos":13,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"9:111"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"9:111"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَيَقْتُلُونَ","en_gloss":"they slay","transliteration":"fayaqtulūna","verse_key":"9:111"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَيُقْتَلُونَ ۖ","en_gloss":"and they are slain","transliteration":"wayuq'talūna","verse_key":"9:111"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَعْدًا","en_gloss":"A promise","transliteration":"waʿdan","verse_key":"9:111"},{"pos":18,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"upon Him","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"9:111"},{"pos":19,"ar":"حَقًّۭا","en_gloss":"true","transliteration":"ḥaqqan","verse_key":"9:111"},{"pos":20,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"9:111"},{"pos":2